<title>HONG KONG: Proview Int'l debuts at HK$1.30/share.</title>
<headline>Proview Int'l debuts at HK$1.30/share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Proview International Holdings Ltd made their trading debut at HK$1.30 per share on Wednesday, compared with their issue price of HK$1.12 each.  </p>
<p>Proview offered a total 130 million new shares at HK$1.12 each in an initial public offering in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The public offering of 117 million shares was 116 times subscribed. Another 13 million shares offered on a preferential basis to employees had been applied for.</p>
<p>Proview designs, makes and sells computer monitors.</p>
<p>    -- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370   http://www.hk97.com</p>
